  "content": "\n\n<h1><span style=\"color:#fff\">這是阿拉伯語模組支援模組的測試版本。這是即將推出更新的測試版本。</span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff1500\">警告：這是測試版本，可能會出現問題。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1>這是針對<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mod-support-arabic-language\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">阿拉伯語模組支援</a>模組即將推出的更新所做的本地化修改測試版&nbsp;</h1>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#ff1500\">提醒：這是測試版本，可能會出現問題&nbsp;</span></h1>\n<h1>模組列表：</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex's Mobs&nbsp;</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mowzies-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mowzie's Mobs&nbsp;</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-monsters\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mutant Monsters</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bossesrise\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bosses'Rise</a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/allthemodium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Allthemodium</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/colossal-chests\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Colossal Chests</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/supplementaries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Supplementaries</a></p>\n<p>將定期更新&nbsp;</p>",
